# steps/named-struct-exec.md §10-11, slice 4 (plan §4 :401; Q19.2: "`left` голым атомом -- тело
# заново"): a bare field of the root declared `Model: fresh` executes Model's body over fresh's value --
# CALL(Model's procedure, the value; §12).  fresh\v was written 7 and reads 2 after: the declaration ran
# again, then the statement.  Model\v stays 1 and another instance, other, stays 5: the code ran over
# fresh's data only.  Executed again from an anonymous block (l2_body_inert): 2 again.  Entry 7.
Model:
    size_t: v 1U
    v: v + 1U
return
Model: fresh
Model: other
fresh\v: 7U
other\v: 5U
fresh
size_t: a 9U
a: fresh\v
fresh\v: 7U
---
    fresh
size_t: b 9U
b: fresh\v
size_t: m 9U
m: Model\v
size_t: o 9U
o: other\v
int: ok 0
if: a = 2U && b = 2U && m = 1U && o = 5U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
